### Register a new user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "aswin2",
    "email": "aswin@gmail.com",
    "password": "321"
}

### Login and get auth token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "aswin2",
    "password": "321"
}


### Create a new workout session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/workouts/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token f297881350e0bce4ba963b8b07604caf298cbc48

{
    "category": "PULL",
    "notes": "lat pull-down 3*10 reps,dumbel curls 3*10 reps"
}

### Get all my workout sessions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/workouts/
Authorization: Token f297881350e0bce4ba963b8b07604caf298cbc48


### Get a single workout session
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/workouts/1/
Authorization: Token f297881350e0bce4ba963b8b07604caf298cbc48

### Update a workout session
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/workouts/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token f297881350e0bce4ba963b8b07604caf298cbc48

{
    "category": "PULL",
    "notes": "Switched to back and biceps today"
}

### Delete a workout session
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/workouts/1/
Authorization: Token f297881350e0bce4ba963b8b07604caf298cbc48